# Alias Imports

Use the `@/*` path alias (defined in `tsconfig.json`) instead of relative imports like `../` or `../../`.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD – relative imports
import { Button } from "../../components/ui/button";
import { cn } from "../../lib/utils";
import type { Zombie } from "../../types/data";

// ✅ GOOD – alias imports
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";
import type { Zombie } from "@/types/data";
```

The alias maps `@/*` to the project root (`./*`). Prefer it for all internal imports to keep paths stable and readable.
